{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56232","headline":"咏鴈山十八寺 · 贯休","name":"咏鴈山十八寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"本觉凌云到宝冠，[能]（张）仁古塔上飞泉。\n普门罗汉石门里，瑞鹿华岩天柱边。\n古洞灵峰真际并，灵岩霞嶂净名连。\n石梁不与双峰远，十八精蓝绒鴈[巅]（岭）。\n（未字不韵，疑爲「山」之误。\n见《全浙诗话》卷九引《瓯江逸志》。\n陈耀东云见光绪《乐清县志》卷十六，今据以校改。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56232.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56232","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}